# SCF submission working material — competitive analysis, panel preparation, reviewer
# research, draft upstream texts. It lives OUTSIDE this repository, at ../scf, and must
# never be published here. These patterns are belt-and-braces: if anything is ever copied
# in by mistake, git refuses to stage it.
